{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"储能","country":"蒙古国","country_iso":"MNG","created_at":"2026-03-23T11:06:57.503024","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"MNG-ES-0002","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"蒙古国80MW/200MWh储能电站项目","project_name_en":"Mongolia 80MW/200MWh Energy Storage Power Station Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中天科技集团","content":"日前，\n“80MW/200MWh储能电站EPC项目” 举行奠基仪式\n，蒙古国总理奥云额尔登出席并致辞，蒙古国能源部部长塔宾贝赫、多名国会议员、国家电力调度中心总监、ADB代表等出席。中天科技国际部总经理叶智峰、中天科技国际工程总包负责人车彬以及项目团队参加了本次仪式。\n蒙古国总理奥云额尔登致辞\n伴随着热烈的掌声，与会领导与嘉宾一起挥动铁锹，共同为项目培土奠基，蒙古国“80MW/200MWh储能电站EPC”项目正式开启。\n蒙古国领导等为项目培土奠基\n“80MW/200MWh储能电站EPC”项目是蒙古国的第一个大型储能项目，中天科技提供的该系统充分考虑了蒙古国极端低温环境（-45℃），同时具备调频调峰功能、集成度高、安全性能好等特点，能有效减少现场安装、调试和后期维护的工作量。\n蒙古国能源部部长塔宾贝赫表示，“中天科技的200MWh容量的可充电电网储能是\n蒙古能源系统以前从未有过的急需技术\n，这一项目能在高峰负荷期间向综合电网提供高达 80 兆瓦的电力，并减少蒙古对进口能源的依赖。”","content_sha256":"929e138e2685949a3306d1fdb6075d8a47787f5c16849ac0b1c096dae5a9b98f","id":15569,"publish_date":"2022-08-06 08:28:01","title":"中天科技参与的蒙古国首个大型储能项目启动","title_sha256":"5969c1f6e069f5dd8548c9554b40b48227dc1bb679a4b274c7ff4c02c09820ee","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/31052.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MNG-ES-0002","capacity_details":"BESS: 80MW","capacity_mw":80.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"80","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T11:06:57.504496","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"MNG-ES-0002-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.ztt.cn/news/show-53179.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"2022-08-01","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"Unknown",